    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Direct answer: continuous camera Y positioning is not exposed by the proven gameplay-camera native. It exposes horizontal offset and distance; the only real vertical/framing control found is binary LOW/NORMAL. I have not added a fake Y setting. I did fix the held-key speed: it now updates every 16 ms at 0.05 per step (about 9x the prior rate), with Shift retaining the 0.005 fine step. This is in the newly built deferred-install artifact; no runtime claim yet.",
